&lt;p&gt;08&sol;2008 - NOTE: Transmittal 94, dated August 29, 2008 rescinds and replaces Transmittal 91, dated July 25, 2008. The only change is a clarification to the verbiage under the Policy section of the Business Requirements at I.B.3. All other information remains the same. Additionally, this clarification does not in any way constitute revisions to the corresponding NCD at 240.4 of Pub 100-03. (&lt;a href=&quot;https:&sol;&sol;www.cms.gov&sol;Regulations-and-Guidance&sol;Guidance&sol;Transmittals&sol;Downloads&sol;R94NCD.pdf&quot;&gt;TN 94&lt;&sol;a&gt;) (CR6048)&lt;&sol;p&gt; 

&lt;p&gt;07&sol;2008 - After reconsideration, coverage for CPAP therapy for OSA is expanded to include a positive diagnosis of OSA made using a home sleep test under specified criteria. Effective date: 03&sol;13&sol;2008. Implementation date: 08&sol;04&sol;2008. (&lt;a href=&quot;https:&sol;&sol;www.cms.gov&sol;Regulations-and-Guidance&sol;Guidance&sol;Transmittals&sol;Downloads&sol;R91NCD.pdf&quot;&gt;TN 91&lt;&sol;a&gt;) (CR6048)&lt;&sol;p&gt; 

&lt;p&gt;05&sol;2005 - Found insufficient evidence to conclude that unattended portable multi-channel sleep study testing is reasonable and necessary in diagnosis of OSA for CPAP therapy, and these tests remain non-covered for this purpose. Effective date 04&sol;04&sol;2005. Implementation date 06&sol;06&sol;2005. (&lt;a href=&quot;https:&sol;&sol;www.cms.gov&sol;Regulations-and-Guidance&sol;Guidance&sol;Transmittals&sol;Downloads&sol;R35NCD.pdf&quot;&gt;TN 35&lt;&sol;a&gt;) (CR 3843)&lt;&sol;p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;12&sol;2001 - Expanded coverage for use in obstructive sleep apnea. Effective and implementation dates 04&sol;01&sol;2002. (&lt;a href=&quot;https:&sol;&sol;www.cms.gov&sol;Regulations-and-Guidance&sol;Guidance&sol;Transmittals&sol;Downloads&sol;R150CIM.pdf&quot;&gt;TN 150&lt;&sol;a&gt;) (CR 1949)&lt;&sol;p&gt; 

&lt;p&gt;06&sol;1987 - Revised indications for treatment to include patients for whom surgery is a likely alternative to CPAP, and deleted documentation requirements. Effective date 01&sol;12&sol;1987. (TN 15)&lt;&sol;p&gt; 

&lt;p&gt;12&sol;1986 - Provided coverage when used in adult patients with moderate or severe obstructive sleep apnea who have failed to obtain relief from other non-invasive therapies. Effective date 01&sol;12&sol;1987. (TN 12)&lt;&sol;p&gt;
